      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, so my doctor recently told me i need to focus on my bone density because it's getting a bit low, so i started taking this really strong daily vitamin K supplement. i'm also on warfarin for my heart rhythm... i just wanted to check if it's okay to keep taking both to make sure i'm getting the best results for my bones?",
